# Skills permitted to exceed their size cap, per ADR 005.
#
# This file is a backlog, not a settings file. Every line is a debt, and adding
# one shows up in a diff so the exception is argued rather than assumed. The
# caps and the tiers live in scripts/token-budget.sh.
#
# Every entry is measured, never estimated: run `make token-report`, and add a
# line only for a skill the report shows over its cap. Shrink the skill in a
# later PR and delete its line when you do.

# --- Contract documents: the bulk is spec, not rationale --------------------
# Both carry a format or a set of script contracts that cannot compress
# without losing the thing a caller reads them for. question-format holds a
# worked template of about 1,150 bytes on its own.
question-format
issue-context-internals
issue-draft-reader

# --- prose-style: five rules plus three reference tables --------------------
# Shrinks when the tables move to an ADR and the skill keeps the rules only.
prose-style

# --- Composite skills still above the 12,000 composite cap ------------------
# Each orchestrates five or more skills. start-issue and tackle-pr-comment are
# the two largest in the collection and the obvious next targets.
start-issue
tackle-pr-comment
finish-issue
release-article

# --- Ordinary skills above 8,000 -------------------------------------------
# No dedicated slimming pass yet; each is over on its own content.
changelog
cleanup-issue
commit-msg
create-github-issue
create-jira-issue
